<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Medical raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Medical raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns upgraded FPA Medical Management Inc to buy from attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 19 Wednesday.</p>
